    "body": "## Bully NX Port — Initial Release\r\n\r\n### Overview\r\n\r\nNintendo Switch port of *Bully: Anniversary Edition* using the Android 64-bit (arm64-v8a) version.\r\n\r\nRuns by loading original assets and `libGame.so` from an official APK.\r\n\r\nNo game files are included.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Requirements\r\n\r\nOfficial **Bully: Anniversary Edition APK v1.4.311 (arm64-v8a)**\r\n\r\nRequired files:\r\n\r\n* `assets/`\r\n* `lib/arm64-v8a/libc++_shared.so`\r\n* `lib/arm64-v8a/libGame.so`\r\n\r\nModded or cracked APKs are not supported.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n\r\nCreate:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsdmc:/switch/bully/\r\n```\r\n\r\nCopy:\r\n\r\n```\r\nyour_port.nro\r\nconfig.txt (optional)\r\n```\r\n\r\nFrom APK:\r\n\r\n```\r\nassets/                → sdmc:/switch/bully/assets/\r\nlibc++_shared.so       → sdmc:/switch/bully/\r\nlibGame.so             → sdmc:/switch/bully/libBully.so\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Expected Layout\r\n\r\n```\r\nsdmc:/switch/bully/\r\n├── your_port.nro\r\n├── libc++_shared.so\r\n├── libBully.so\r\n├── config.txt\r\n└── assets/\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\n* `assets/data_0.zip` is required for startup\r\n* Saves are not fully implemented (stored next to `.nro`)\r\n* Only supports the 64-bit Android build\r\n* Shadows are expensive; set to 1 in `config.txt` for better performance\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Legal\r\n\r\nUse only assets from an officially obtained copy.\r\n\r\nDo not distribute game files with this port.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Credits\r\n\r\n* givethesourceplox — porting work\r\n* TheOfficialFloW and PS Vita contributors — method and groundwork",
